      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Spoolo.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 2 as a monster. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Spore 5 — spore hearing</strong> — Liberated Toads — Spore 5</p><p>Status: Listed — Liberated Toads roster #58, not yet seen in the field</p><p>Spoolo is roster entry #58 of the Liberated Toads: one of the five spore creatures the roster keeps in the Spore 5 — not a toad, and never chosen by the appointment chain. The roster lists its weapon as spore hearing; cap colour spore; listed, not yet seen in the field. That is the whole record, and Waluigi files the whole record: a face on the roster beats a rumour in a barrel. WAH.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Claws</strong> — “Spore 5 — spore hearing”</li><li><strong>Grasping Growth</strong> — “Spore 5 — spore hearing”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/toad_spoolo</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/toad_spoolo</code>.</p>",
